# Eval questions — {{KB_NAME}}

Three typical questions the owner asks this base. Used as a **manual**
before/after check when instructions change. Not indexed (`eval/**` is
excluded from Repomix).

How to run: open a **fresh** agent session, ask each question, save the
answers in `eval/results/<YYYY-MM-DD>__<what-changed>.md` with a
pass/fail note per bullet. No `kb_eval.py` — this is a human comparison.

Fill the placeholders during deploy (`02_INIT` Q6). Keep rejected
alternatives in the "must NOT propose" line so a trim of `AGENTS.md`
cannot silently revive them.

